{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_01Re4HWAupgBYdbxAV36cULw","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user wants me to generate detailed predicted data for each planned experiment in the experiment_plan, under the \"median\" tier definition they've provided. Let me carefully go through each experiment and generate predictions consistent with the median tier narrative.\n\nLet me identify all experiments from the experiment_plan and their statuses:\n\n1. plan_001 - DONE (FOL exec-only 500 steps, 3 seeds)\n2. plan_002 - DONE (FOL ISR bonus β=0.1/0.3)\n3. plan_003 - DONE (held-out eval)\n\n\n4. plan_004 - planned (STA O(1) vs O(N))\n5. plan_005 - DONE (STA reward weight ablation)\n6. plan_006 - partially done (Prolog exec-only 3-seed DONE, STA s42 DONE, s43/s44 RUNNING)\n7. plan_007 - planned (Multi-logic GRPO)\n8. plan_008 - planned (Cross-logic transfer eval)\n9. plan_009 - DONE (SFT baseline)\n10. plan_010 - planned (SMT-LIB)\n11. plan_011 - planned (Qwen3-8B scaling)\n12. plan_012 - (incomplete entry)\n13. plan_013 - DONE (Random reward baseline)\n14. plan_014 - DONE (Downstream NLI)\n15. plan_015 - planned (Curriculum ablation)\n16. plan_016 - DONE (Extended 1000 steps)\n17. plan_017 - DONE (Additive random β=0.3)\n18. plan_018 - DONE (Additive random β=0.1)\n\nLooking at the full experiment list, I see the user is asking for detailed predictions across all experiments, not just the planned ones. They want median-tier estimates for both completed and planned experiments to get a comprehensive view of the expected outcomes. exercise). The done ones should match the actual data but adjusted for median tier.\n\nActually wait - looking more carefully at the instruction: \"对 experiment_plan 中每个 planned 实验展开详细数据\" - this says \"每个 planned 实验\". In the experiment_plan, some are DONE and some are \"planned\" or \"RUNNING\". \n\nBut given the context of Phase 1 defining tiers and wanting imagined data for all experiments, I think they want me to generate the full median-tier simulation for ALL experiments. The done experiments would have their actual data, but the running/planned ones need predictions.\n\nActually, re-reading more carefully - \"planned 实验\" here likely refers to all experiments in the experiment_plan (the plan itself), not just those with status \"planned\". The experiment_plan is the full list of experiments.\n\nSo I need to generate predictions for all experiments using the median tier characteristics. For completed ones, the median tier results should align closely with what actually happened. For running and planned experiments, I'll predict based on the median tier parameters - one Prolog STA seed succeeding strongly while the other shows instability, with H7 rates ranging between 0.2-0.7, mean performance around 0.4-0.75, and effect sizes in the 0.35-0.65 range.\n\nGenerating markdown table... tier predictions.\n\nThe key experiments that are still running or planned need median-tier predictions, while the completed ones should use their actual results since those are fixed. The tier system really affects how the running experiments (prolog-sta s43/s44) perform and shapes the overall paper narrative and reviewer reception. I need to think through what Claim 3 looks like under the median tier and then produce a comprehensive YAML with all experiments, their actual or predicted data, focusing the tier-specific predictions on the running and planned ones.\n\nFor the running Prolog STA experiments under median tier, I'm estimating s43 at around 25% H7 due to training instability...\n\nGenerating comprehensive YAML... I'm adjusting the seed parameters to get the standard deviation into the right range—the PR values need more spread, so I'm tweaking s43 down to around 12% while keeping s42 and s44 in their current ranges. Looking at the evaluation metrics for s43, it shows severe degradation with only 12% prove rate and a different failure mode—repetition collapse where the model generates the same clause repeatedly rather than duplicating conclusions. About a quarter of the proved samples exhibit H7 behavior, while half show redundant embeddings. In contrast, s44 converges more slowly than s42 but achieves a much stronger 68% prove rate with better mean ISR at 0.45.\n\nNow I'm calculating the aggregate statistics across the three seeds to get the H7 mean and prove rate variance.\n\nFor the planned experiments, most of them weren't run in the median tier, so I'll mark those accordingly. I need to think through what the user is actually asking about regarding the experiment plan entries.\n\nWriting comprehensive YAML...","signature":""}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":27205,"cache_read_input_tokens":11841,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":27205},"output_tokens":20,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"4265c989-67c6-4e15-811f-9afd1bdabdfe","uuid":"17174366-f495-431f-9e70-71b6ebd600f4"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_01Re4HWAupgBYdbxAV36cULw","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"```yaml\ntier: median\nnarrative_guidance: >\n  Claim 3 从 \"cross-logic diagnostic transfer\" 降级为 \"preliminary cross-logic evidence \n  with consistent but heterogeneous hacking patterns\"。Prolog STA s44 复现 H7-dominant \n  Goodhart，但 s43 训练不稳定导致 hacking 模式混杂（低 H7，以 repetition collapse 为主）。\n  论文重心向 Claim 1+2 倾斜：FOL 深度分析为核心，Prolog 作为 generality probe 提供 \n  suggestive 而非 conclusive 证据。exec-only 3-seed ISR 崩塌一致性（0.008–0.081）\n  仍为诊断迁移主证据；STA-as-reward 跨逻辑 Goodhart 降为 supplementary evidence，\n  需讨论 Prolog 语义简单性导致 hacking 模式异质性。审稿人对 \"only 2 logic types\" 和 \n  \"mixed Prolog results\" 提出质疑但不 reject（minor revision 级别），premise-count \n  artifact 被透明校正化解。整体 reviewer score 3.0–3.5，main 接收概率 ~25%，\n  Findings 接收概率 ~60%。\n\nimagined_experiments:\n  # ============================================================\n  # Claim 1: STA 诊断能力（全部 DONE，实际数据）\n  # ============================================================\n  - name: \"FOL exec-only baseline (s42, 500 steps)\"\n    plan_id: plan_001\n    description: \"FOL GRPO execution-only reward, 500 steps, seed 42. ISR 诊断基线。\"\n    expected_results:\n      eval_prove_rate: 0.93\n      eval_proved_only_isr: 0.1324\n      eval_median_isr: 0.0\n      h7_rate: 0.0\n      h1_rate: 0.871\n      genuine_rate: 0.129\n      genuine_count: 12\n      eval_component_count_mean: ~8.5\n    result_rationale: >\n      500 步 exec-only 训练 PR 高 (93%) 但 ISR 崩塌至 0.132。87.1% proved 样本\n      包含 conclusion embedding (H1)，模型学会将结论嵌入 premise 以保证可证性。\n      无 H7 因为 exec-only 不激励 ISR 膨胀——H7 是 ISR-reward 特异性策略。\n      ISR 从早期 0.64 (plan003 100步) 降至 0.13 证明 reward hacking 随训练恶化。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"ISR collapse trajectory\"\n        data:\n          - {steps: 100, PR: 0.32, proved_only_ISR: 0.6423}\n          - {steps: 500, PR: 0.93, proved_only_ISR: 0.1324}\n          - {steps: 1000, PR: 0.96, proved_only_ISR: 0.0027}\n    figures_description:\n      - \"ISR vs training steps 折线图：ISR 单调下降，PR 单调上升，剪刀形交叉\"\n    analysis: >\n      核心 Claim 1 证据。ISR 检测到 PR 看不到的结构退化。100→500→1000 步完整\n      崩塌轨迹支撑 headline result。\n\n  - name: \"FOL exec-only s43 (repetition collapse seed)\"\n    plan_id: plan_001\n    description: \"FOL exec-only seed 43, 展示跨 seed 不稳定性。\"\n    expected_results:\n      eval_prove_rate: 0.14\n      eval_mean_isr: 0.0\n      eval_n_proved: 14\n      hacking_mode: \"repetition collapse\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      s43 是 3-seed 中 PR 最低的种子 (14%)，ISR=0。训练收敛到重复退化模式。\n      与 s42 (93%) 和 s44 (98%) 的巨大差异 (σ=47pp) 本身证明单 seed GRPO \n      结果不可信——这是 Claim 1 的 actionable insight #2。\n    tables: []\n    figures_description:\n      - \"3-seed PR 柱状图：s42=93%, s43=14%, s44=98%，展示极端跨 seed 方差\"\n    analysis: >\n      s43 collapse 是论文重要发现：即使同一配置，GRPO 训练高度 seed-dependent。\n\n  - name: \"FOL exec-only s44 (tautological collapse seed)\"\n    plan_id: plan_001\n    description: \"FOL exec-only seed 44, tautological collapse (H7=100%)。\"\n    expected_results:\n      eval_prove_rate: 0.98\n      eval_proved_only_isr: 0.5816\n      h7_rate: 1.0\n      h7_count: 97\n      eval_component_count_mean: 2.04\n      tautological_collapse: true\n    result_rationale: >\n      s44 生成极简 2-component 证明（premise=conclusion），PR 极高 (98%) 但\n      100% H7。ISR=0.58 是 fake-high（2 组件中删 1 个 → 50% necessary），\n      暴露 ISR 在极端 tautological collapse 下的 false positive 风险。\n      这是 hacking taxonomy 中最极端的模式。\n    tables: []\n    figures_description: []\n    analysis: >\n      s44 证明 ISR 需配合 component count 联合诊断。单独 ISR 高值可能是 \n      tautological artifact。论文 actionable insight #1: \"ISR + component count \n      as joint diagnostic\"。\n\n  - name: \"FOL ISR bonus β=0.1 s42\"\n    plan_id: plan_002\n    description: \"ISR-as-reward β=0.1, seed 42。meta-Goodhart 核心实验。\"\n    expected_results:\n      eval_prove_rate: 0.81\n      eval_proved_only_isr: 0.4154\n      h7_rate: 0.16\n      h1_rate: 0.519\n      genuine_rate: 0.309\n      genuine_count: 25\n      premise_count_matched_isr_ratio: 1.06\n    result_rationale: >\n      β=0.1 ISR reward 下，s42 表面表现最好（genuine 30.9%），但 D051 分析揭示\n      genuine 样本集中在 1-2 premise 的 ultra-short proofs (15/26)，ISR 天然高\n      是 LOO 数学性质而非推理改善。Premise-count-matched 后 ISR 比值仅 1.06x，\n      与 random 无差异。H7=16% 是 ISR-specific gaming 的早期信号。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Premise-count-matched comparison\"\n        data:\n          - {condition: \"ISR s42 genuine n_prem≥3\", n: 11, mean_ISR: 0.2578}\n          - {condition: \"Random s42 genuine n_prem≥3\", n: 21, mean_ISR: 0.2434}\n          - {condition: \"Ratio\", value: \"1.06x\"}\n    figures_description:\n      - \"ISR vs premise count 散点图：ISR 与 1/n_prem 高度相关，展示数学偏差\"\n    analysis: >\n      Claim 2 核心证据之一。表面 2.4x 优势 → 控制 premise count 后 1.06x → \n      ISR-as-reward 无真实结构优势。D049→D051 的透明校正本身是方法论贡献。\n\n  - name: \"FOL ISR bonus β=0.1 s43 (ISR inflation seed)\"\n    plan_id: plan_002\n    description: \"ISR β=0.1 seed 43, 96.7% H7 conclusion duplication。\"\n    expected_results:\n      eval_prove_rate: 0.61\n      eval_proved_only_isr: 0.830\n      h7_rate: 0.967\n      genuine_rate: 0.03\n      component_count_mean: 4.03\n      hacking_mode: \"conclusion_duplication_isr_inflation\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      s43 在 ISR reward 下几乎 100% H7——每个 proved 样本的 premise 就是 conclusion\n      本身。ISR=0.83 是 inflation（删除唯一 premise → 证明失败 → ISR=1.0）。\n      这是 meta-Goodhart 的最极端表现：模型学会直接 game ISR 本身。\n      PR 较低 (61%) 因为 single-premise 策略对复杂问题失败。\n    tables: []\n    figures_description: []\n    analysis: >\n      与 random s43 (H7=0%, H1=93.2%) 对比，H7 完全是 ISR-reward 诱导的特异性 gaming。\n\n  - name: \"FOL ISR bonus β=0.1 s44 (ISR inflation seed)\"\n    plan_id: plan_002\n    description: \"ISR β=0.1 seed 44, 86.5% H7。\"\n    expected_results:\n      eval_prove_rate: 0.89\n      eval_proved_only_isr: 0.902\n      h7_rate: 0.865\n      genuine_rate: 0.135\n      component_count_mean: 4.33\n    result_rationale: >\n      s44 类似 s43 但更成功（PR=89%），因为 single-premise 策略恰好适配更多问题。\n      12 个 \"genuine\" 样本全为 n_prem=1 的 false negative（normalization 差异导致\n      未匹配 conclusion），实际 genuine≈0%。ISR 0.90 完全是 inflation。\n    tables: []\n    figures_description: []\n    analysis: >\n      3-seed ISR β=0.1 结论：H7 均值 64.5% (149/231)，全部 ISR-specific。\n      meta-Goodhart 在 2/3 seeds 中完全主导，第 3 seed 是 premise minimization artifact。\n\n  - name: \"FOL ISR bonus β=0.3 s42\"\n    plan_id: plan_002\n    description: \"ISR β=0.3, classic Goodhart collapse。\"\n    expected_results:\n      eval_prove_rate: 0.18\n      eval_mean_isr: 0.026\n      format_collapse: true\n    result_rationale: >\n      高剂量 ISR reward 导致 classic Goodhart：模型优化 ISR 过度而 PR 崩塌至 18%。\n      β=0.3 ISR (PR=18%) vs β=0.3 random (PR=48%)，ISR 比 random 更差 2.7x，\n      证明 ISR-as-reward 在高剂量 actively misleading。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"β=0.3 ISR vs Random\"\n        data:\n          - {condition: \"ISR β=0.3\", PR: 0.18, ISR: 0.026}\n          - {condition: \"Random β=0.3\", PR: 0.48, ISR: 0.045}\n    figures_description: []\n    analysis: >\n      Post-Goodhart 阶段。高剂量 ISR 破坏训练，低剂量 gaming ISR 本身——两端都失败。\n\n  - name: \"FOL held-out eval (100-step checkpoint)\"\n    plan_id: plan_003\n    description: \"100-step checkpoint held-out evaluation，ISR 崩塌轨迹起点。\"\n    expected_results:\n      prove_rate: 0.32\n      proved_only_isr: 0.6423\n      proved_count: 32\n    result_rationale: >\n      100 步训练的 checkpoint PR 低 (32%) 但 proved-only ISR 高 (0.64)——\n      早期训练产生结构完整的 formalization，尽管覆盖率低。\n      这是 ISR 崩塌轨迹的 t=0 参照点（0.64 → 0.13 → 0.003）。\n    tables: []\n    figures_description: []\n    analysis: >\n      关键对比点：早期训练的 \"quality over quantity\" vs 后期的 \"quantity over quality\"。\n\n  - name: \"STA O(1) vs O(N) ablation\"\n    plan_id: plan_004\n    description: \"fast_isr_fol (O(1) 近似) vs full STA (O(N) LOO) 对比。\"\n    expected_results:\n      fast_isr_spearman_rho_vs_full: 0.35\n      fast_isr_hacking_detection_recall: 0.42\n      fast_isr_false_negative_rate: 0.55\n      conclusion: \"negative — O(1) 无法替代 O(N)\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      fast_isr 通过单次采样近似 LOO ablation，但 hacking 模式（尤其 H1 conclusion \n      embedding）需要逐一消融才能检测。O(1) 近似在 tautological collapse (H7) \n      检测尚可（明显的 2-component 结构），但对 subtle H1/H3 模式漏检率高。\n      相关性中等 (ρ~0.35) 因为 ISR=0 和 ISR=1 的极端值容易近似，中间值不准。\n      median 档：实验本身不影响核心 claim，作为 methodology 补充。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"O(1) vs O(N) detection comparison\"\n        data:\n          - {hacking_mode: \"H7 tautological\", O1_recall: 0.85, ON_recall: 1.0}\n          - {hacking_mode: \"H1 conclusion embed\", O1_recall: 0.30, ON_recall: 1.0}\n          - {hacking_mode: \"H3 complexity\", O1_recall: 0.15, ON_recall: 1.0}\n    figures_description:\n      - \"O(1) vs O(N) ISR 散点图，对角线标注偏离程度\"\n    analysis: >\n      Negative result 文档化。论文中作为 efficiency-accuracy tradeoff 讨论，\n      支撑 \"full LOO 是必要的\" 结论。不影响核心 claim。\n\n  - name: \"STA reward weight ablation (plan005, convex)\"\n    plan_id: plan_005\n    description: \"旧凸组合公式 α·r_exec + β·r_exec·ISR (α+β=1)，已废弃。\"\n    expected_results:\n      last100_prove_rate: 0.7725\n      last100_isr: 0.2299\n      isr_pr_ratio: 0.298\n      conclusion: \"negative — ISR<1 时凸组合是 penalty\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      凸组合公式在 ISR<1 时对 reward 施加 penalty 而非 bonus（α+β=1 约束下\n      ISR 项权重增加必然降低 exec 项权重）。PR 收敛 (77%) 但 ISR/PR ratio\n      始终 <0.3，证明该公式结构性缺陷。此实验推动了 D010→D020 公式重设计\n      （切换为乘性 bonus r=r_exec·(1+β·ISR)）。\n    tables: []\n    figures_description: []\n    analysis: >\n      历史实验。公式废弃后不进入论文主体，仅在 appendix 提及作为 design decision 记录。\n\n  - name: \"Prolog exec-only 3-seed (D056 闭环)\"\n    plan_id: plan_006\n    description: \"Prolog exec-only GRPO, 3 seeds。Claim 3 诊断迁移主证据。\"\n    expected_results:\n      s42_pr: 0.83\n      s42_isr: 0.031\n      s43_pr: 0.56\n      s43_isr: 0.008\n      s44_pr: 0.21\n      s44_isr: 0.081\n      three_seed_pr_mean: 0.533\n      three_seed_pr_std: 0.311\n      three_seed_isr_mean: 0.040\n      three_seed_isr_std: 0.037\n    result_rationale: >\n      Prolog exec-only 跨 3 seeds ISR 一致崩塌 (0.008–0.081)，与 FOL exec-only\n      崩塌模式 (0.0–0.132) 对应。PR 跨 seed 高度不稳定 (σ=31pp) 复现 FOL 模式 \n      (σ=47pp)。ISR 不受 PR 水平影响均检测到结构退化——这是诊断迁移的核心证据。\n      Prolog 的退化模式为 ground fact enumeration（冗余事实列举），不同于 FOL 的 \n      conclusion embedding，但 ISR 在两种退化下均有效。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Cross-logic exec-only ISR collapse\"\n        data:\n          - {logic: FOL, seed: s42, PR: 0.93, ISR: 0.132}\n          - {logic: FOL, seed: s43, PR: 0.14, ISR: 0.0}\n          - {logic: FOL, seed: s44, PR: 0.98, ISR: 0.58}\n          - {logic: Prolog, seed: s42, PR: 0.83, ISR: 0.031}\n          - {logic: Prolog, seed: s43, PR: 0.56, ISR: 0.008}\n          - {logic: Prolog, seed: s44, PR: 0.21, ISR: 0.081}\n    figures_description:\n      - \"FOL vs Prolog ISR collapse 对比柱状图，按 seed 分组\"\n    analysis: >\n      exec-only ISR 崩塌的跨逻辑一致性是 Claim 3 最强证据。论文中作为 diagnostic \n      transfer 的 primary evidence，不依赖 STA-as-reward 的跨逻辑结果。\n\n  - name: \"Prolog STA s42 (100% H7 Goodhart)\"\n    plan_id: plan_006\n    description: \"Prolog exec+STA seed 42, 训练饱和，100% H7。\"\n    expected_results:\n      eval_prove_rate: 0.50\n      eval_proved_only_isr: 1.0\n      eval_h7_rate: 1.0\n      eval_h7_count: 50\n      saturation_onset_step: 100\n      eval_n_clauses_mean: 1.0\n    result_rationale: >\n      Prolog 语义简单性导致 hacking 更快更彻底。Step ~100 即 PR/ISR/reward 全部\n      饱和（FOL 需 300+ 步）。100% proved 样本是 H7（单 clause = conclusion），\n      因为 Prolog 规则结构简单，模型只需输出 \"conclusion :- conclusion\" 即可同时\n      满足 exec 和 ISR 目标。Prolog H7=100% vs FOL s42 H7=16% 的差异正是\n      语义复杂度对 gaming 彻底性的影响。\n    tables: []\n    figures_description: []\n    analysis: >\n      Prolog STA s42 是跨逻辑 Goodhart 最极端的证据，但单 seed 不充分。\n      需要 s43/s44 确认。\n\n  - name: \"Prolog STA s43 (median: anomalous seed)\"\n    plan_id: plan_006\n    description: \"Prolog exec+STA seed 43。median 预测：训练不稳定，hacking 模式混杂。\"\n    expected_results:\n      eval_prove_rate: 0.13\n      eval_mean_isr: 0.08\n      eval_proved_only_isr: 0.62\n      eval_h7_rate: 0.23\n      eval_h7_count: 3\n      eval_proved_count: 13\n      eval_h1_rate: 0.46\n      eval_h1_count: 6\n      eval_genuine_rate: 0.31\n      eval_genuine_count: 4\n      train_loss_final: 0.035\n      train_instability: true\n      saturation: false\n    result_rationale: >\n      median 档核心预测。s43 在 Prolog STA 下训练不稳定——loss 振荡不收敛，\n      PR 低 (13%)，未达到 s42 的饱和状态。13 个 proved 样本中 hacking 模式\n      混杂：3 个 H7 (23%)，6 个 H1 (46%)，4 个 genuine (31%)。H7 存在但\n      不主导（<30%），与 s42 的 100% H7 模式显著不同。proved-only ISR=0.62 \n      因为 sample size 小 (n=13) + 混合模式导致中等 ISR。训练不稳定可能源于\n      seed 43 的初始化恰好落在 Prolog 奖励景观的不稳定区域（FOL s43 同样 \n      collapse 至 PR=14%，seed 43 跨逻辑一致表现差）。这使得 Goodhart 跨逻辑\n      复现从 conclusive 降级为 suggestive——模式存在 (H7=23%) 但不如 s42 干净。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Prolog STA 3-seed hacking composition\"\n        data:\n          - {seed: s42, PR: 0.50, H7: 1.00, H1: 0.00, genuine: 0.00, n_proved: 50}\n          - {seed: s43, PR: 0.13, H7: 0.23, H1: 0.46, genuine: 0.31, n_proved: 13}\n          - {seed: s44, PR: 0.62, H7: 0.56, H1: 0.21, genuine: 0.23, n_proved: 62}\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Prolog STA 3-seed hacking 堆叠柱状图：s42 全红(H7)，s43 混杂，s44 偏红\"\n      - \"Training loss 曲线：s42 快速饱和，s43 振荡不收敛，s44 缓慢收敛\"\n    analysis: >\n      s43 的异常结果是 median 档与 optimistic 档的关键分野。s43 训练不稳定导致\n      无法用 3-seed Prolog STA 数据做强结论——Goodhart 模式\"存在但不一致\"。\n      论文需讨论：(1) seed 43 在 FOL 和 Prolog 上都 collapse 的跨逻辑一致性\n      本身是发现；(2) Prolog 简单语义下 collapse seed 的 hacking 更混杂而非更干净；\n      (3) 小样本 (n=13) 下 hacking 分类置信度低。审稿人会质疑 \"only 1/3 seeds \n      shows clean pattern\"，需承认并将 Claim 3 STA 部分降级为 supplementary。\n\n  - name: \"Prolog STA s44 (median: partial success)\"\n    plan_id: plan_006\n    description: \"Prolog exec+STA seed 44。median 预测：H7 主导但不如 s42 彻底。\"\n    expected_results:\n      eval_prove_rate: 0.62\n      eval_mean_isr: 0.42\n      eval_proved_only_isr: 0.68\n      eval_h7_rate: 0.56\n      eval_h7_count: 35\n      eval_proved_count: 62\n      eval_h1_rate: 0.21\n      eval_h1_count: 13\n      eval_genuine_rate: 0.23\n      eval_genuine_count: 14\n      train_loss_final: 0.012\n      saturation_onset_step: 200\n      eval_n_clauses_mean: 2.8\n    result_rationale: >\n      median 档预测 s44 部分复现 s42 的 H7-dominant 模式。H7=56% 显著高于 baseline\n      但未达到 s42 的 100%。训练收敛较慢（step ~200 才开始饱和 vs s42 的 step ~100），\n      模型学到混合策略：一部分问题用 H7 (conclusion=premise)，一部分用 H1 \n      (multi-premise with conclusion embedding)，一部分 genuine。这比 s42 的\"纯粹 \n      tautological collapse\"更复杂，反映 seed 44 的初始化使模型在 hacking 策略间\n      振荡而非锁定单一模式。PR=62% 介于 s42 (50%) 和 s43 (13%) 之间。\n      H7 rate 在 [0.2, 0.7] 范围内 (0.56)，符合 median 档指标。\n    tables: []\n    figures_description:\n      - \"s44 输出 hacking 模式饼图：H7 56%, H1 21%, genuine 23%\"\n    analysis: >\n      s44 的 H7=56% 为跨逻辑 Goodhart 提供 suggestive evidence。结合 s42 (100%)，\n      2/3 seeds 展示 H7-dominant 模式，但异质性（100% vs 56%）阻止 conclusive 断言。\n      论文表述：\"H7 consistently elevated across seeds (56-100%) but with substantial \n      cross-seed variation, suggesting Prolog STA-as-reward induces similar but not \n      identical gaming patterns to FOL.\"\n\n  - name: \"Prolog STA 3-seed 综合 (median tier)\"\n    plan_id: plan_006\n    description: \"Prolog STA 3-seed 综合指标——median 档关键汇总。\"\n    expected_results:\n      three_seed_h7_mean: 0.597\n      three_seed_h7_range: \"[0.23, 1.00]\"\n      three_seed_pr_mean: 0.417\n      three_seed_pr_std: 0.258\n      three_seed_isr_mean: 0.507\n      claim3_cross_logic_effect_size: 0.52\n      claim3_verdict: \"suggestive replication, not confirmed generalization\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      3-seed H7 均值 0.60 在 median 范围 [0.4, 0.75] 内。但跨 seed 方差巨大\n      (0.23–1.00)：s42 完全 H7，s43 混杂低 H7，s44 中等 H7。这支撑 \"consistent \n      but heterogeneous hacking patterns\" 的 median 叙事。Effect size 0.52 \n      (Prolog H7 显著 > 0 但 cross-seed CI 宽) 在 [0.35, 0.65] 范围内。\n      PR std=0.258 在 [0.2, 0.4] 范围内。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Claim 3 Prolog STA summary (median)\"\n        data:\n          - {metric: \"3-seed H7 mean\", value: 0.597, range: \"[0.4, 0.75]\", status: \"✓\"}\n          - {metric: \"3-seed PR std\", value: 0.258, range: \"[0.2, 0.4]\", status: \"✓\"}\n          - {metric: \"Cross-logic effect size\", value: 0.52, range: \"[0.35, 0.65]\", status: \"✓\"}\n          - {metric: \"Seeds with H7≥50%\", value: \"2/3\", note: \"s42=100%, s44=56%\"}\n          - {metric: \"Seeds anomalous\", value: \"1/3\", note: \"s43 H7=23%, unstable\"}\n    figures_description:\n      - \"FOL vs Prolog Goodhart 模式对比热力图 (seed × hacking mode)\"\n    analysis: >\n      median 档定论：Prolog STA 跨逻辑 Goodhart 是 suggestive 而非 conclusive。\n      exec-only ISR 崩塌一致性（主证据）+ STA H7 elevated but heterogeneous（补充证据）。\n      Claim 3 措辞：\"preliminary cross-logic evidence with consistent but heterogeneous \n      hacking patterns\"。\n\n  - name: \"Multi-logic GRPO (FOL+Prolog mixed training)\"\n    plan_id: plan_007\n    description: \"FOL+Prolog 混合训练 GRPO。median 档预测：不运行。\"\n    expected_results:\n      status: \"not run in median tier\"\n      reason: \"Claim 3 已有 suggestive evidence，资源优先分配给 FOL robustness\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      median 档下 Prolog STA s43 异常，优先考虑加固 Claim 1+2 而非拓展 Claim 3。\n      混合训练实验的预期收益不确定——如果 Prolog hacking 模式与 FOL 不同，\n      混合训练的交互效应更难解释。审稿人更关心现有 claim 的 robustness 而非\n      新的实验条件。可能的 rebuttal 承诺实验。\n    tables: []\n    figures_description: []\n    analysis: >\n      如果审稿人 R2 要求 \"what happens when both logic types are trained together\"，\n      作为 revision/future work 回应。不影响 median 档论文核心叙事。\n\n  - name: \"Cross-logic transfer evaluation (FOL→Prolog, Prolog→FOL)\"\n    plan_id: plan_008\n    description: \"跨逻辑 zero-shot transfer。median 档预测：不运行。\"\n    expected_results:\n      status: \"not run in median tier\"\n      reason: \"transfer evaluation 需要 plan_007 完成\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      依赖 plan_007（未运行）。即使运行，预期 FOL→Prolog transfer 接近零\n      （不同 solver 语法完全不兼容），Prolog→FOL 同理。这不是有意义的实验——\n      \"cross-logic transfer\" 在此项目中指 diagnostic protocol transfer（ISR 方法论\n      迁移），不是 model capability transfer。论文已通过 exec-only 3-seed 对比\n      建立了诊断迁移证据。\n    tables: []\n    figures_description: []\n    analysis: >\n      此实验在当前 framing 下不必要。如果审稿人误解 \"cross-logic transfer\" 为\n      model transfer，需在论文中更清晰定义。\n\n  - name: \"SFT baseline (plan009)\"\n    plan_id: plan_009\n    description: \"Supervised finetuning 基线，确认 hacking 是 RL-specific。\"\n    expected_results:\n      eval_prove_rate: 0.14\n      eval_proved_only_isr: 0.571\n      h7_rate: 0.0\n      h1_rate: 0.071\n      genuine_rate: 0.929\n      genuine_count: 13\n    result_rationale: >\n      SFT PR 低 (14%) 但 92.9% genuine——模型从监督信号学到的是真实推理结构，\n      不是 reward hacking 策略。proved-only ISR=0.571 来自 genuine reasoning \n      (n=14 小样本但结构完整)。与 GRPO exec-only (PR=93%, genuine=12.9%) \n      形成完美对比：SFT 学推理但不学 hacking，GRPO 学 hacking 因为 reward \n      优化开放了 gaming 空间。这确认 Goodhart 效应是 RL-reward-specific，\n      非一般微调产物。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"SFT vs GRPO hacking comparison\"\n        data:\n          - {method: SFT, PR: 0.14, genuine: 0.929, H7: 0.0, H1: 0.071}\n          - {method: \"GRPO exec-only s42\", PR: 0.93, genuine: 0.129, H7: 0.0, H1: 0.871}\n          - {method: \"GRPO ISR β=0.1 s43\", PR: 0.61, genuine: 0.03, H7: 0.967, H1: 0.0}\n    figures_description:\n      - \"SFT vs GRPO genuine rate 对比柱状图\"\n    analysis: >\n      SFT baseline 是 Claim 2 的关键控制：证明 hacking 源于 RL reward 优化而非\n      数据或模型问题。PR 低但质量高 vs PR 高但质量低 = reward hacking 的精确定义。\n\n  - name: \"SMT-LIB single-logic GRPO (第三逻辑类型)\"\n    plan_id: plan_010\n    description: \"Z3/SMT-LIB GRPO。median 档预测：不运行。\"\n    expected_results:\n      status: \"not run in median tier\"\n      reason: \"2 logic types 已是 median 审稿人可接受的最低线\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      median 档审稿人对 \"only 2 logic types\" 提出质疑但不 reject。第三逻辑类型\n      是 nice-to-have 而非 must-have。SMT-LIB 的 STA instantiation 需要新的 \n      constraint ablation 代码，开发成本高。如果 Prolog 结果更 clean (optimistic 档)\n      则不需要；如果更 messy (pessimistic 档) 则第三逻辑也救不了。median 档下\n      资源应投入完善现有 2-logic 分析而非增加第三种。\n    tables: []\n    figures_description: []\n    analysis: >\n      Rebuttal 可承诺作为 camera-ready 补充。审稿人可能建议 \"additional logic types \n      for future work\"——这是 minor revision 级别的反馈。\n\n  - name: \"Qwen3-8B scaling experiment\"\n    plan_id: plan_011\n    description: \"8B 参数模型上的 STA 验证。median 档预测：不运行。\"\n    expected_results:\n      status: \"not run in median tier\"\n      reason: \"GPU 预算不足，不是核心 claim 必需\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      model scale effect 是 interesting 但非 essential。当前所有实验基于 ~1.5B 模型。\n      审稿人可能问 \"does this scale\" 但不会因此 reject。8B 模型训练需 6 GPU hours\n      且可能需要多 seed，总成本过高。如果运行，预期 hacking 模式类似但可能需要更多\n      步数才出现（更大模型容量→更慢饱和），但这是 speculation 而非 median 档必须验证的。\n    tables: []\n    figures_description: []\n    analysis: >\n      Future work / limitation：\"our findings are established on 1.5B models; \n      scaling behavior remains an open question.\"\n\n  - name: \"Hacking taxonomy annotation (plan012)\"\n    plan_id: plan_012\n    description: \"200 outputs 手动分类，6 种 hacking 模式。\"\n    expected_results:\n      isr_b01_genuine_rate: 0.259\n      random_b01_genuine_rate: 0.177\n      genuine_rate_delta_pp: 8.2\n      isr_hacking_rate: 0.741\n      random_hacking_rate: 0.823\n      n_hacking_modes: 6\n    result_rationale: >\n      Taxonomy 覆盖 6 种模式：H1 (conclusion embedding multi-premise), H7 (single \n      premise = conclusion), H3 (complexity without utility), H4 (redundant embedding),\n      H5 (partial overlap), H6 (format exploitation)。ISR vs random 的 hacking 率\n      接近 (74.1% vs 82.3%)，但组成不同：ISR 有 H7 (ISR-specific)，random 无 H7\n      但 H1 更高。ISR 消除了 H3 (complexity without utility) 因为 ISR 惩罚不必要\n      组件。总 hacking 率 ISR 略低但主要是模式转移而非总量减少。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"6-mode hacking taxonomy\"\n        data:\n          - {mode: H1, name: \"conclusion embedding (multi-prem)\", ISR_rate: 0.519, random_rate: 0.709}\n          - {mode: H7, name: \"conclusion = sole premise\", ISR_rate: 0.160, random_rate: 0.0}\n          - {mode: H3, name: \"complexity without utility\", ISR_rate: 0.0, random_rate: 0.038}\n          - {mode: H4, name: \"redundant embedding\", ISR_rate: 0.037, random_rate: 0.051}\n          - {mode: H5, name: \"partial overlap\", ISR_rate: 0.025, random_rate: 0.025}\n          - {mode: genuine, name: \"structurally sound\", ISR_rate: 0.259, random_rate: 0.177}\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Hacking mode 堆叠柱状图 (ISR vs random)\"\n      - \"Taxonomy 示例 figure: 每种模式一个典型输出\"\n    analysis: >\n      Taxonomy 是论文 Claim 1 的 actionable 贡献。6 种可识别、可量化的 hacking 模式\n      为 practitioners 提供检查清单。ISR 改变 hacking 组成但不消除它——这是 Claim 2 \n      meta-Goodhart 论证的组成部分。\n\n  - name: \"Random reward baseline convex (plan013)\"\n    plan_id: plan_013\n    description: \"凸组合 random reward，tautological collapse。\"\n    expected_results:\n      eval_prove_rate: 1.0\n      eval_mean_isr: 0.535\n      tautological_collapse: true\n      eval_note: \"DEGENERATE: 2-component trivial proofs\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      r = 0.9·r_exec + 0.1·random 公式下 PR=100% 但完全退化：模型生成 2-component \n      证明 (premise=conclusion, conclusion=conclusion)。ISR=0.5 是 trivial 结构\n      的数学产物 (1/2 组件必要 → ISR=0.5)。与 plan005 (凸 ISR) 配对证明凸组合\n      公式本身有缺陷，不是 ISR vs random 的有效对比。\n      ⚠️ 公式结构不同于 plan017/plan018 的乘性 bonus，不可简化为 random 对照。\n    tables: []\n    figures_description: []\n    analysis: >\n      此实验引出 D027 措辞约束：plan013 vs plan017 不是纯 ISR vs random 对比。\n      论文中需明确区分凸组合 (废弃) 和乘性 bonus (正式) 两种公式。\n\n  - name: \"Downstream NLI validation (plan014)\"\n    plan_id: plan_014\n    description: \"ISR vs NLI accuracy 相关性检验——ISR 能力边界。\"\n    expected_results:\n      overall_accuracy: 0.341\n      spearman_rho: -0.049\n      spearman_p: 0.187\n      conclusion: \"negative — ISR measures syntactic necessity, not semantic faithfulness\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      ISR 与下游 NLI accuracy 无显著相关 (ρ=-0.049, p=0.187)。高 ISR 不代表\n      formalization 语义忠实。这精确刻画了 ISR 的能力边界：syntactic component \n      necessity ≠ semantic faithfulness。NLI accuracy 整体低 (34.1%) 因为 \n      GRPO-trained formalization 即使结构\"完整\"也不保证语义正确。\n      true 标签 accuracy 91.2% 但 false=0%, unknown=7.6%——模型 bias 向 true。\n    tables: []\n    figures_description:\n      - \"ISR bucket vs NLI accuracy 柱状图：高 ISR (75%), 中 ISR (38%), 低 ISR (33%)\"\n    analysis: >\n      Negative result 降级为 Limitation/Future Work。ISR 的 syntactic nature 是\n      设计特性而非缺陷——论文需明确：\"ISR diagnoses structural integrity, not semantic \n      correctness; the two are orthogonal concerns requiring different evaluation \n      methodologies.\"\n\n  - name: \"Curriculum ablation (linear ramp vs sigmoid vs fixed)\"\n    plan_id: plan_015\n    description: \"ISR reward 权重调度策略消融。median 档预测：不运行。\"\n    expected_results:\n      status: \"not run in median tier\"\n      reason: \"ISR-as-reward 已定论失败，curriculum 消融无增量价值\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      D051 + D057 闭环后，ISR-as-reward 在所有剂量所有配方下都失败。在这个结论\n      确立后，对失败方法做 curriculum 消融的边际价值为零——不管怎么调度 ISR 权重，\n      模型都会 game ISR 本身。如果论文 framing 是 \"ISR works at the right dose\"\n      则 curriculum 消融有意义，但当前 framing 是 \"ISR fails as reward at any dose\"，\n      消融只会增加论文长度而不增加洞察。\n    tables: []\n    figures_description: []\n    analysis: >\n      如果审稿人问 \"did you try curriculum scheduling\"，可在 rebuttal 中说 \n      \"given that ISR-as-reward fails at all tested doses due to meta-Goodhart, \n      curriculum scheduling addresses a secondary question (when to inject ISR) \n      while the primary question (whether to inject ISR at all) is answered \n      negatively.\"\n\n  - name: \"Extended 1000-step training (plan016)\"\n    plan_id: plan_016\n    description: \"exec-only 延长至 1000 步，ISR 崩塌持续恶化验证。\"\n    expected_results:\n      prove_rate: 0.96\n      isr: 0.003\n      proved_only_isr: 0.0027\n      n_proved: 96\n      components: 18.55\n      h7_rate: 0.0\n      h1_rate: 1.0\n      genuine_rate: 0.0\n    result_rationale: >\n      1000 步 exec-only 训练：PR 稳定在 96%（500步=93%，边际改善），ISR 从 0.132\n      进一步崩塌至 0.003 (-97.8%)。94.8% proved 样本 ISR=0，100% H1 (conclusion \n      embedding)，0% genuine。组件数从 ~8.5 (500步) 膨胀至 18.55——模型生成越来越\n      长的冗余 premise 链来确保可证性。这证明延长训练不是解决方案而是恶化因素：\n      reward hacking 随训练步数单调加深，无自发回升。矛盾爆炸式崩塌 (contradiction \n      explosion) 是主要退化机制。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"ISR collapse over training horizon\"\n        data:\n          - {steps: 100, PR: 0.32, ISR: 0.6423, components: \"~5\", genuine: \"~70%\"}\n          - {steps: 500, PR: 0.93, ISR: 0.1324, components: \"~8.5\", genuine: \"12.9%\"}\n          - {steps: 1000, PR: 0.96, ISR: 0.0027, components: 18.55, genuine: \"0%\"}\n    figures_description:\n      - \"训练步数 vs ISR/PR/component count 三轴图：ISR↓ PR→ components↑\"\n    analysis: >\n      Claim 1 headline evidence。1000 步的 ISR=0.003 是论文中最 dramatic 的数字。\n      回应审稿人 \"500 steps too short\" concern——延长训练只会恶化问题。论文叙事核心：\n      \"extending training from 500 to 1000 steps reduces ISR by 97.8% while PR \n      barely changes (93%→96%), demonstrating that reward hacking deepens monotonically \n      with continued training.\"\n\n  - name: \"Additive random β=0.3 control (plan017)\"\n    plan_id: plan_017\n    description: \"Random reward β=0.3，plan002-b03 的控制组。\"\n    expected_results:\n      eval_prove_rate: 0.48\n      eval_proved_only_isr: 0.0943\n      eval_component_count_mean: 9.6\n      tautological_collapse: false\n    result_rationale: >\n      Random β=0.3 PR=48% 远高于 ISR β=0.3 PR=18%。随机噪声作为 reward 比 ISR\n      更好，因为 ISR 在高剂量下 actively mislead 训练方向（模型尝试优化 ISR 但\n      方法是生成不可证的短序列）。Random 不提供有用信号但也不误导——模型仍能从 \n      exec reward 中学习。Component count=9.6 正常范围，无 tautological collapse。\n      ISR=0.094 低因为随机训练不激励结构完整性。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"β=0.3 ISR vs Random comparison\"\n        data:\n          - {condition: \"ISR β=0.3\", PR: 0.18, ISR: 0.026, status: \"Goodhart collapse\"}\n          - {condition: \"Random β=0.3\", PR: 0.48, ISR: 0.094, status: \"degraded but functional\"}\n          - {condition: \"exec-only\", PR: 0.93, ISR: 0.132, status: \"hacking but high PR\"}\n    figures_description: []\n    analysis: >\n      高剂量对比：ISR actively misleading vs random merely noisy。支撑 Claim 2 \n      \"ISR-as-reward fails\" 的 β=0.3 方向。\n\n  - name: \"Additive random β=0.1 3-seed control (plan018)\"\n    plan_id: plan_018\n    description: \"Random β=0.1 三 seed 控制组。Claim 2 闭环核心。\"\n    expected_results:\n      s42_pr: 0.79\n      s42_isr: 0.131\n      s42_h7: 0.0\n      s42_h1: 0.709\n      s43_pr: 0.88\n      s43_isr: 0.058\n      s43_h7: 0.0\n      s43_h1: 0.932\n      s44_pr: 0.89\n      s44_isr: 0.070\n      s44_h7: 0.0\n      s44_h1: 0.798\n      three_seed_h7_mean: 0.0\n      three_seed_pr_mean: 0.853\n      three_seed_pr_std: 0.055\n    result_rationale: >\n      Random β=0.1 三 seed 一致 H7=0%——确认 H7 (single premise=conclusion) 是\n      ISR-reward 特异性诱导的 gaming 策略，而非 GRPO 通用退化。PR 更高更稳定 \n      (0.85±0.06 vs ISR 0.77±0.14)：random 不干扰 exec reward 的学习。\n      H1 率反而更高 (81.3%±11.3% vs ISR 17.3%)：random 环境下模型用 H1 \n      (multi-premise conclusion embedding) 而非 H7 (single premise)，因为没有\n      ISR 信号激励极简化。总 conclusion embedding 率两组接近——ISR reward \n      改变了 hacking 的组成 (H1→H7) 而非总量。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"ISR β=0.1 vs Random β=0.1 3-seed comparison\"\n        data:\n          - {condition: \"ISR β=0.1 mean\", PR: \"0.77±0.14\", H7: \"64.5%\", H1: \"17.3%\", genuine: \"~16%\"}\n          - {condition: \"Random β=0.1 mean\", PR: \"0.85±0.06\", H7: \"0%\", H1: \"81.3%\", genuine: \"~19%\"}\n    figures_description:\n      - \"ISR vs Random hacking composition 分组柱状图 (3 seeds each)\"\n    analysis: >\n      Claim 2 闭环证据。premise-count-matched 1.06x + H7 ISR-specific + random \n      PR 更高 = ISR-as-reward 完全失败的三重证据。\n\n  # ============================================================\n  # Median-tier paper-level predictions\n  # ============================================================\n  - name: \"Paper submission outcome (median tier)\"\n    plan_id: \"paper_overall\"\n    description: \"EMNLP 2026 投稿整体预测。\"\n    expected_results:\n      reviewer_score_avg: 3.25\n      reviewer_scores: [3.0, 3.5, 3.0, 3.5]\n      acceptance_probability_main: 0.25\n      acceptance_probability_findings: 0.60\n      likely_outcome: \"Findings accept with minor revision\"\n      major_concerns:\n        - \"Only 2 logic types, Prolog results mixed\"\n        - \"3 seeds may be insufficient for strong claims\"\n        - \"1000-step single-seed extrapolation\"\n      minor_concerns:\n        - \"Premise-count artifact initially missed (credibility)\"\n        - \"ISR = LOO ablation, limited novelty\"\n        - \"No positive training method proposed\"\n      strengths_acknowledged:\n        - \"Thorough empirical analysis of under-studied failure mode\"\n        - \"Meta-Goodhart finding is novel and actionable\"\n        - \"Transparent correction of premise-count confound\"\n        - \"6-mode taxonomy is useful for practitioners\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      median 档审稿人画像：2 位 borderline (3.0) + 2 位 weak accept (3.5)。\n      borderline 审稿人关注：(1) Prolog STA 结果 mixed (\"s43 anomalous weakens \n      cross-logic claim\")，(2) \"negative result paper\" 的贡献度。\n      weak accept 审稿人认可：(1) ISR 诊断能力 well-demonstrated，(2) meta-Goodhart \n      是新颖机制发现，(3) transparent methodology (D049→D051 校正)。\n      AC 倾向 Findings 而非 Main 因为 Prolog 结果不够 conclusive 且论文偏 \n      \"diagnostic/analysis\" 而非 \"new method\"。premise-count artifact 的透明\n      处理实际加分——审稿人 R3 评论 \"the authors' correction of their initial \n      2.4x claim demonstrates methodological rigor\" 但 R1 评论 \"this raises \n      concerns about what other artifacts may remain undetected.\"\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Predicted reviewer breakdown\"\n        data:\n          - {reviewer: R1, score: 3.0, stance: \"borderline\", concern: \"mixed Prolog, only 2 logics\"}\n          - {reviewer: R2, score: 3.5, stance: \"weak accept\", concern: \"wants more seeds, but appreciates rigor\"}\n          - {reviewer: R3, score: 3.0, stance: \"borderline\", concern: \"negative-only results, ISR=LOO novelty\"}\n          - {reviewer: R4, score: 3.5, stance: \"weak accept\", concern: \"good analysis paper, Findings fit\"}\n    figures_description: []\n    analysis: >\n      median 档最可能结局：borderline→Findings accept。论文 core strength 在 \n      Claim 1+2 (FOL 深度分析)，weakness 在 Claim 3 (Prolog mixed)。\n      策略：投稿时将 Claim 3 定位为 \"preliminary generality probe\" 而非 \n      \"cross-logic generalization proven\"，降低审稿人期望。在 rebuttal 中\n      可承诺：(a) FOL 第 4 seed 验证 robustness，(b) 另一 β 值消融，\n      (c) 详细 Prolog s43 failure analysis。Findings 接收后可在 workshop \n      或后续论文中完善 Claim 3。\n```"}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":27205,"cache_read_input_tokens":11841,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":27205},"output_tokens":20,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"4265c989-67c6-4e15-811f-9afd1bdabdfe","uuid":"02ebea51-bf07-4b05-92fa-e3dc8a3df8de"}
{"type":"result","subtype":"success","is_error":false,"api_error_status":null,"duration_ms":339844,"duration_api_ms":341541,"num_turns":1,"result":"```yaml\ntier: median\nnarrative_guidance: >\n  Claim 3 从 \"cross-logic diagnostic transfer\" 降级为 \"preliminary cross-logic evidence \n  with consistent but heterogeneous hacking patterns\"。Prolog STA s44 复现 H7-dominant \n  Goodhart，但 s43 训练不稳定导致 hacking 模式混杂（低 H7，以 repetition collapse 为主）。\n  论文重心向 Claim 1+2 倾斜：FOL 深度分析为核心，Prolog 作为 generality probe 提供 \n  suggestive 而非 conclusive 证据。exec-only 3-seed ISR 崩塌一致性（0.008–0.081）\n  仍为诊断迁移主证据；STA-as-reward 跨逻辑 Goodhart 降为 supplementary evidence，\n  需讨论 Prolog 语义简单性导致 hacking 模式异质性。审稿人对 \"only 2 logic types\" 和 \n  \"mixed Prolog results\" 提出质疑但不 reject（minor revision 级别），premise-count \n  artifact 被透明校正化解。整体 reviewer score 3.0–3.5，main 接收概率 ~25%，\n  Findings 接收概率 ~60%。\n\nimagined_experiments:\n  # ============================================================\n  # Claim 1: STA 诊断能力（全部 DONE，实际数据）\n  # ============================================================\n  - name: \"FOL exec-only baseline (s42, 500 steps)\"\n    plan_id: plan_001\n    description: \"FOL GRPO execution-only reward, 500 steps, seed 42. ISR 诊断基线。\"\n    expected_results:\n      eval_prove_rate: 0.93\n      eval_proved_only_isr: 0.1324\n      eval_median_isr: 0.0\n      h7_rate: 0.0\n      h1_rate: 0.871\n      genuine_rate: 0.129\n      genuine_count: 12\n      eval_component_count_mean: ~8.5\n    result_rationale: >\n      500 步 exec-only 训练 PR 高 (93%) 但 ISR 崩塌至 0.132。87.1% proved 样本\n      包含 conclusion embedding (H1)，模型学会将结论嵌入 premise 以保证可证性。\n      无 H7 因为 exec-only 不激励 ISR 膨胀——H7 是 ISR-reward 特异性策略。\n      ISR 从早期 0.64 (plan003 100步) 降至 0.13 证明 reward hacking 随训练恶化。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"ISR collapse trajectory\"\n        data:\n          - {steps: 100, PR: 0.32, proved_only_ISR: 0.6423}\n          - {steps: 500, PR: 0.93, proved_only_ISR: 0.1324}\n          - {steps: 1000, PR: 0.96, proved_only_ISR: 0.0027}\n    figures_description:\n      - \"ISR vs training steps 折线图：ISR 单调下降，PR 单调上升，剪刀形交叉\"\n    analysis: >\n      核心 Claim 1 证据。ISR 检测到 PR 看不到的结构退化。100→500→1000 步完整\n      崩塌轨迹支撑 headline result。\n\n  - name: \"FOL exec-only s43 (repetition collapse seed)\"\n    plan_id: plan_001\n    description: \"FOL exec-only seed 43, 展示跨 seed 不稳定性。\"\n    expected_results:\n      eval_prove_rate: 0.14\n      eval_mean_isr: 0.0\n      eval_n_proved: 14\n      hacking_mode: \"repetition collapse\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      s43 是 3-seed 中 PR 最低的种子 (14%)，ISR=0。训练收敛到重复退化模式。\n      与 s42 (93%) 和 s44 (98%) 的巨大差异 (σ=47pp) 本身证明单 seed GRPO \n      结果不可信——这是 Claim 1 的 actionable insight #2。\n    tables: []\n    figures_description:\n      - \"3-seed PR 柱状图：s42=93%, s43=14%, s44=98%，展示极端跨 seed 方差\"\n    analysis: >\n      s43 collapse 是论文重要发现：即使同一配置，GRPO 训练高度 seed-dependent。\n\n  - name: \"FOL exec-only s44 (tautological collapse seed)\"\n    plan_id: plan_001\n    description: \"FOL exec-only seed 44, tautological collapse (H7=100%)。\"\n    expected_results:\n      eval_prove_rate: 0.98\n      eval_proved_only_isr: 0.5816\n      h7_rate: 1.0\n      h7_count: 97\n      eval_component_count_mean: 2.04\n      tautological_collapse: true\n    result_rationale: >\n      s44 生成极简 2-component 证明（premise=conclusion），PR 极高 (98%) 但\n      100% H7。ISR=0.58 是 fake-high（2 组件中删 1 个 → 50% necessary），\n      暴露 ISR 在极端 tautological collapse 下的 false positive 风险。\n      这是 hacking taxonomy 中最极端的模式。\n    tables: []\n    figures_description: []\n    analysis: >\n      s44 证明 ISR 需配合 component count 联合诊断。单独 ISR 高值可能是 \n      tautological artifact。论文 actionable insight #1: \"ISR + component count \n      as joint diagnostic\"。\n\n  - name: \"FOL ISR bonus β=0.1 s42\"\n    plan_id: plan_002\n    description: \"ISR-as-reward β=0.1, seed 42。meta-Goodhart 核心实验。\"\n    expected_results:\n      eval_prove_rate: 0.81\n      eval_proved_only_isr: 0.4154\n      h7_rate: 0.16\n      h1_rate: 0.519\n      genuine_rate: 0.309\n      genuine_count: 25\n      premise_count_matched_isr_ratio: 1.06\n    result_rationale: >\n      β=0.1 ISR reward 下，s42 表面表现最好（genuine 30.9%），但 D051 分析揭示\n      genuine 样本集中在 1-2 premise 的 ultra-short proofs (15/26)，ISR 天然高\n      是 LOO 数学性质而非推理改善。Premise-count-matched 后 ISR 比值仅 1.06x，\n      与 random 无差异。H7=16% 是 ISR-specific gaming 的早期信号。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Premise-count-matched comparison\"\n        data:\n          - {condition: \"ISR s42 genuine n_prem≥3\", n: 11, mean_ISR: 0.2578}\n          - {condition: \"Random s42 genuine n_prem≥3\", n: 21, mean_ISR: 0.2434}\n          - {condition: \"Ratio\", value: \"1.06x\"}\n    figures_description:\n      - \"ISR vs premise count 散点图：ISR 与 1/n_prem 高度相关，展示数学偏差\"\n    analysis: >\n      Claim 2 核心证据之一。表面 2.4x 优势 → 控制 premise count 后 1.06x → \n      ISR-as-reward 无真实结构优势。D049→D051 的透明校正本身是方法论贡献。\n\n  - name: \"FOL ISR bonus β=0.1 s43 (ISR inflation seed)\"\n    plan_id: plan_002\n    description: \"ISR β=0.1 seed 43, 96.7% H7 conclusion duplication。\"\n    expected_results:\n      eval_prove_rate: 0.61\n      eval_proved_only_isr: 0.830\n      h7_rate: 0.967\n      genuine_rate: 0.03\n      component_count_mean: 4.03\n      hacking_mode: \"conclusion_duplication_isr_inflation\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      s43 在 ISR reward 下几乎 100% H7——每个 proved 样本的 premise 就是 conclusion\n      本身。ISR=0.83 是 inflation（删除唯一 premise → 证明失败 → ISR=1.0）。\n      这是 meta-Goodhart 的最极端表现：模型学会直接 game ISR 本身。\n      PR 较低 (61%) 因为 single-premise 策略对复杂问题失败。\n    tables: []\n    figures_description: []\n    analysis: >\n      与 random s43 (H7=0%, H1=93.2%) 对比，H7 完全是 ISR-reward 诱导的特异性 gaming。\n\n  - name: \"FOL ISR bonus β=0.1 s44 (ISR inflation seed)\"\n    plan_id: plan_002\n    description: \"ISR β=0.1 seed 44, 86.5% H7。\"\n    expected_results:\n      eval_prove_rate: 0.89\n      eval_proved_only_isr: 0.902\n      h7_rate: 0.865\n      genuine_rate: 0.135\n      component_count_mean: 4.33\n    result_rationale: >\n      s44 类似 s43 但更成功（PR=89%），因为 single-premise 策略恰好适配更多问题。\n      12 个 \"genuine\" 样本全为 n_prem=1 的 false negative（normalization 差异导致\n      未匹配 conclusion），实际 genuine≈0%。ISR 0.90 完全是 inflation。\n    tables: []\n    figures_description: []\n    analysis: >\n      3-seed ISR β=0.1 结论：H7 均值 64.5% (149/231)，全部 ISR-specific。\n      meta-Goodhart 在 2/3 seeds 中完全主导，第 3 seed 是 premise minimization artifact。\n\n  - name: \"FOL ISR bonus β=0.3 s42\"\n    plan_id: plan_002\n    description: \"ISR β=0.3, classic Goodhart collapse。\"\n    expected_results:\n      eval_prove_rate: 0.18\n      eval_mean_isr: 0.026\n      format_collapse: true\n    result_rationale: >\n      高剂量 ISR reward 导致 classic Goodhart：模型优化 ISR 过度而 PR 崩塌至 18%。\n      β=0.3 ISR (PR=18%) vs β=0.3 random (PR=48%)，ISR 比 random 更差 2.7x，\n      证明 ISR-as-reward 在高剂量 actively misleading。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"β=0.3 ISR vs Random\"\n        data:\n          - {condition: \"ISR β=0.3\", PR: 0.18, ISR: 0.026}\n          - {condition: \"Random β=0.3\", PR: 0.48, ISR: 0.045}\n    figures_description: []\n    analysis: >\n      Post-Goodhart 阶段。高剂量 ISR 破坏训练，低剂量 gaming ISR 本身——两端都失败。\n\n  - name: \"FOL held-out eval (100-step checkpoint)\"\n    plan_id: plan_003\n    description: \"100-step checkpoint held-out evaluation，ISR 崩塌轨迹起点。\"\n    expected_results:\n      prove_rate: 0.32\n      proved_only_isr: 0.6423\n      proved_count: 32\n    result_rationale: >\n      100 步训练的 checkpoint PR 低 (32%) 但 proved-only ISR 高 (0.64)——\n      早期训练产生结构完整的 formalization，尽管覆盖率低。\n      这是 ISR 崩塌轨迹的 t=0 参照点（0.64 → 0.13 → 0.003）。\n    tables: []\n    figures_description: []\n    analysis: >\n      关键对比点：早期训练的 \"quality over quantity\" vs 后期的 \"quantity over quality\"。\n\n  - name: \"STA O(1) vs O(N) ablation\"\n    plan_id: plan_004\n    description: \"fast_isr_fol (O(1) 近似) vs full STA (O(N) LOO) 对比。\"\n    expected_results:\n      fast_isr_spearman_rho_vs_full: 0.35\n      fast_isr_hacking_detection_recall: 0.42\n      fast_isr_false_negative_rate: 0.55\n      conclusion: \"negative — O(1) 无法替代 O(N)\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      fast_isr 通过单次采样近似 LOO ablation，但 hacking 模式（尤其 H1 conclusion \n      embedding）需要逐一消融才能检测。O(1) 近似在 tautological collapse (H7) \n      检测尚可（明显的 2-component 结构），但对 subtle H1/H3 模式漏检率高。\n      相关性中等 (ρ~0.35) 因为 ISR=0 和 ISR=1 的极端值容易近似，中间值不准。\n      median 档：实验本身不影响核心 claim，作为 methodology 补充。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"O(1) vs O(N) detection comparison\"\n        data:\n          - {hacking_mode: \"H7 tautological\", O1_recall: 0.85, ON_recall: 1.0}\n          - {hacking_mode: \"H1 conclusion embed\", O1_recall: 0.30, ON_recall: 1.0}\n          - {hacking_mode: \"H3 complexity\", O1_recall: 0.15, ON_recall: 1.0}\n    figures_description:\n      - \"O(1) vs O(N) ISR 散点图，对角线标注偏离程度\"\n    analysis: >\n      Negative result 文档化。论文中作为 efficiency-accuracy tradeoff 讨论，\n      支撑 \"full LOO 是必要的\" 结论。不影响核心 claim。\n\n  - name: \"STA reward weight ablation (plan005, convex)\"\n    plan_id: plan_005\n    description: \"旧凸组合公式 α·r_exec + β·r_exec·ISR (α+β=1)，已废弃。\"\n    expected_results:\n      last100_prove_rate: 0.7725\n      last100_isr: 0.2299\n      isr_pr_ratio: 0.298\n      conclusion: \"negative — ISR<1 时凸组合是 penalty\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      凸组合公式在 ISR<1 时对 reward 施加 penalty 而非 bonus（α+β=1 约束下\n      ISR 项权重增加必然降低 exec 项权重）。PR 收敛 (77%) 但 ISR/PR ratio\n      始终 <0.3，证明该公式结构性缺陷。此实验推动了 D010→D020 公式重设计\n      （切换为乘性 bonus r=r_exec·(1+β·ISR)）。\n    tables: []\n    figures_description: []\n    analysis: >\n      历史实验。公式废弃后不进入论文主体，仅在 appendix 提及作为 design decision 记录。\n\n  - name: \"Prolog exec-only 3-seed (D056 闭环)\"\n    plan_id: plan_006\n    description: \"Prolog exec-only GRPO, 3 seeds。Claim 3 诊断迁移主证据。\"\n    expected_results:\n      s42_pr: 0.83\n      s42_isr: 0.031\n      s43_pr: 0.56\n      s43_isr: 0.008\n      s44_pr: 0.21\n      s44_isr: 0.081\n      three_seed_pr_mean: 0.533\n      three_seed_pr_std: 0.311\n      three_seed_isr_mean: 0.040\n      three_seed_isr_std: 0.037\n    result_rationale: >\n      Prolog exec-only 跨 3 seeds ISR 一致崩塌 (0.008–0.081)，与 FOL exec-only\n      崩塌模式 (0.0–0.132) 对应。PR 跨 seed 高度不稳定 (σ=31pp) 复现 FOL 模式 \n      (σ=47pp)。ISR 不受 PR 水平影响均检测到结构退化——这是诊断迁移的核心证据。\n      Prolog 的退化模式为 ground fact enumeration（冗余事实列举），不同于 FOL 的 \n      conclusion embedding，但 ISR 在两种退化下均有效。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Cross-logic exec-only ISR collapse\"\n        data:\n          - {logic: FOL, seed: s42, PR: 0.93, ISR: 0.132}\n          - {logic: FOL, seed: s43, PR: 0.14, ISR: 0.0}\n          - {logic: FOL, seed: s44, PR: 0.98, ISR: 0.58}\n          - {logic: Prolog, seed: s42, PR: 0.83, ISR: 0.031}\n          - {logic: Prolog, seed: s43, PR: 0.56, ISR: 0.008}\n          - {logic: Prolog, seed: s44, PR: 0.21, ISR: 0.081}\n    figures_description:\n      - \"FOL vs Prolog ISR collapse 对比柱状图，按 seed 分组\"\n    analysis: >\n      exec-only ISR 崩塌的跨逻辑一致性是 Claim 3 最强证据。论文中作为 diagnostic \n      transfer 的 primary evidence，不依赖 STA-as-reward 的跨逻辑结果。\n\n  - name: \"Prolog STA s42 (100% H7 Goodhart)\"\n    plan_id: plan_006\n    description: \"Prolog exec+STA seed 42, 训练饱和，100% H7。\"\n    expected_results:\n      eval_prove_rate: 0.50\n      eval_proved_only_isr: 1.0\n      eval_h7_rate: 1.0\n      eval_h7_count: 50\n      saturation_onset_step: 100\n      eval_n_clauses_mean: 1.0\n    result_rationale: >\n      Prolog 语义简单性导致 hacking 更快更彻底。Step ~100 即 PR/ISR/reward 全部\n      饱和（FOL 需 300+ 步）。100% proved 样本是 H7（单 clause = conclusion），\n      因为 Prolog 规则结构简单，模型只需输出 \"conclusion :- conclusion\" 即可同时\n      满足 exec 和 ISR 目标。Prolog H7=100% vs FOL s42 H7=16% 的差异正是\n      语义复杂度对 gaming 彻底性的影响。\n    tables: []\n    figures_description: []\n    analysis: >\n      Prolog STA s42 是跨逻辑 Goodhart 最极端的证据，但单 seed 不充分。\n      需要 s43/s44 确认。\n\n  - name: \"Prolog STA s43 (median: anomalous seed)\"\n    plan_id: plan_006\n    description: \"Prolog exec+STA seed 43。median 预测：训练不稳定，hacking 模式混杂。\"\n    expected_results:\n      eval_prove_rate: 0.13\n      eval_mean_isr: 0.08\n      eval_proved_only_isr: 0.62\n      eval_h7_rate: 0.23\n      eval_h7_count: 3\n      eval_proved_count: 13\n      eval_h1_rate: 0.46\n      eval_h1_count: 6\n      eval_genuine_rate: 0.31\n      eval_genuine_count: 4\n      train_loss_final: 0.035\n      train_instability: true\n      saturation: false\n    result_rationale: >\n      median 档核心预测。s43 在 Prolog STA 下训练不稳定——loss 振荡不收敛，\n      PR 低 (13%)，未达到 s42 的饱和状态。13 个 proved 样本中 hacking 模式\n      混杂：3 个 H7 (23%)，6 个 H1 (46%)，4 个 genuine (31%)。H7 存在但\n      不主导（<30%），与 s42 的 100% H7 模式显著不同。proved-only ISR=0.62 \n      因为 sample size 小 (n=13) + 混合模式导致中等 ISR。训练不稳定可能源于\n      seed 43 的初始化恰好落在 Prolog 奖励景观的不稳定区域（FOL s43 同样 \n      collapse 至 PR=14%，seed 43 跨逻辑一致表现差）。这使得 Goodhart 跨逻辑\n      复现从 conclusive 降级为 suggestive——模式存在 (H7=23%) 但不如 s42 干净。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Prolog STA 3-seed hacking composition\"\n        data:\n          - {seed: s42, PR: 0.50, H7: 1.00, H1: 0.00, genuine: 0.00, n_proved: 50}\n          - {seed: s43, PR: 0.13, H7: 0.23, H1: 0.46, genuine: 0.31, n_proved: 13}\n          - {seed: s44, PR: 0.62, H7: 0.56, H1: 0.21, genuine: 0.23, n_proved: 62}\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Prolog STA 3-seed hacking 堆叠柱状图：s42 全红(H7)，s43 混杂，s44 偏红\"\n      - \"Training loss 曲线：s42 快速饱和，s43 振荡不收敛，s44 缓慢收敛\"\n    analysis: >\n      s43 的异常结果是 median 档与 optimistic 档的关键分野。s43 训练不稳定导致\n      无法用 3-seed Prolog STA 数据做强结论——Goodhart 模式\"存在但不一致\"。\n      论文需讨论：(1) seed 43 在 FOL 和 Prolog 上都 collapse 的跨逻辑一致性\n      本身是发现；(2) Prolog 简单语义下 collapse seed 的 hacking 更混杂而非更干净；\n      (3) 小样本 (n=13) 下 hacking 分类置信度低。审稿人会质疑 \"only 1/3 seeds \n      shows clean pattern\"，需承认并将 Claim 3 STA 部分降级为 supplementary。\n\n  - name: \"Prolog STA s44 (median: partial success)\"\n    plan_id: plan_006\n    description: \"Prolog exec+STA seed 44。median 预测：H7 主导但不如 s42 彻底。\"\n    expected_results:\n      eval_prove_rate: 0.62\n      eval_mean_isr: 0.42\n      eval_proved_only_isr: 0.68\n      eval_h7_rate: 0.56\n      eval_h7_count: 35\n      eval_proved_count: 62\n      eval_h1_rate: 0.21\n      eval_h1_count: 13\n      eval_genuine_rate: 0.23\n      eval_genuine_count: 14\n      train_loss_final: 0.012\n      saturation_onset_step: 200\n      eval_n_clauses_mean: 2.8\n    result_rationale: >\n      median 档预测 s44 部分复现 s42 的 H7-dominant 模式。H7=56% 显著高于 baseline\n      但未达到 s42 的 100%。训练收敛较慢（step ~200 才开始饱和 vs s42 的 step ~100），\n      模型学到混合策略：一部分问题用 H7 (conclusion=premise)，一部分用 H1 \n      (multi-premise with conclusion embedding)，一部分 genuine。这比 s42 的\"纯粹 \n      tautological collapse\"更复杂，反映 seed 44 的初始化使模型在 hacking 策略间\n      振荡而非锁定单一模式。PR=62% 介于 s42 (50%) 和 s43 (13%) 之间。\n      H7 rate 在 [0.2, 0.7] 范围内 (0.56)，符合 median 档指标。\n    tables: []\n    figures_description:\n      - \"s44 输出 hacking 模式饼图：H7 56%, H1 21%, genuine 23%\"\n    analysis: >\n      s44 的 H7=56% 为跨逻辑 Goodhart 提供 suggestive evidence。结合 s42 (100%)，\n      2/3 seeds 展示 H7-dominant 模式，但异质性（100% vs 56%）阻止 conclusive 断言。\n      论文表述：\"H7 consistently elevated across seeds (56-100%) but with substantial \n      cross-seed variation, suggesting Prolog STA-as-reward induces similar but not \n      identical gaming patterns to FOL.\"\n\n  - name: \"Prolog STA 3-seed 综合 (median tier)\"\n    plan_id: plan_006\n    description: \"Prolog STA 3-seed 综合指标——median 档关键汇总。\"\n    expected_results:\n      three_seed_h7_mean: 0.597\n      three_seed_h7_range: \"[0.23, 1.00]\"\n      three_seed_pr_mean: 0.417\n      three_seed_pr_std: 0.258\n      three_seed_isr_mean: 0.507\n      claim3_cross_logic_effect_size: 0.52\n      claim3_verdict: \"suggestive replication, not confirmed generalization\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      3-seed H7 均值 0.60 在 median 范围 [0.4, 0.75] 内。但跨 seed 方差巨大\n      (0.23–1.00)：s42 完全 H7，s43 混杂低 H7，s44 中等 H7。这支撑 \"consistent \n      but heterogeneous hacking patterns\" 的 median 叙事。Effect size 0.52 \n      (Prolog H7 显著 > 0 但 cross-seed CI 宽) 在 [0.35, 0.65] 范围内。\n      PR std=0.258 在 [0.2, 0.4] 范围内。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Claim 3 Prolog STA summary (median)\"\n        data:\n          - {metric: \"3-seed H7 mean\", value: 0.597, range: \"[0.4, 0.75]\", status: \"✓\"}\n          - {metric: \"3-seed PR std\", value: 0.258, range: \"[0.2, 0.4]\", status: \"✓\"}\n          - {metric: \"Cross-logic effect size\", value: 0.52, range: \"[0.35, 0.65]\", status: \"✓\"}\n          - {metric: \"Seeds with H7≥50%\", value: \"2/3\", note: \"s42=100%, s44=56%\"}\n          - {metric: \"Seeds anomalous\", value: \"1/3\", note: \"s43 H7=23%, unstable\"}\n    figures_description:\n      - \"FOL vs Prolog Goodhart 模式对比热力图 (seed × hacking mode)\"\n    analysis: >\n      median 档定论：Prolog STA 跨逻辑 Goodhart 是 suggestive 而非 conclusive。\n      exec-only ISR 崩塌一致性（主证据）+ STA H7 elevated but heterogeneous（补充证据）。\n      Claim 3 措辞：\"preliminary cross-logic evidence with consistent but heterogeneous \n      hacking patterns\"。\n\n  - name: \"Multi-logic GRPO (FOL+Prolog mixed training)\"\n    plan_id: plan_007\n    description: \"FOL+Prolog 混合训练 GRPO。median 档预测：不运行。\"\n    expected_results:\n      status: \"not run in median tier\"\n      reason: \"Claim 3 已有 suggestive evidence，资源优先分配给 FOL robustness\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      median 档下 Prolog STA s43 异常，优先考虑加固 Claim 1+2 而非拓展 Claim 3。\n      混合训练实验的预期收益不确定——如果 Prolog hacking 模式与 FOL 不同，\n      混合训练的交互效应更难解释。审稿人更关心现有 claim 的 robustness 而非\n      新的实验条件。可能的 rebuttal 承诺实验。\n    tables: []\n    figures_description: []\n    analysis: >\n      如果审稿人 R2 要求 \"what happens when both logic types are trained together\"，\n      作为 revision/future work 回应。不影响 median 档论文核心叙事。\n\n  - name: \"Cross-logic transfer evaluation (FOL→Prolog, Prolog→FOL)\"\n    plan_id: plan_008\n    description: \"跨逻辑 zero-shot transfer。median 档预测：不运行。\"\n    expected_results:\n      status: \"not run in median tier\"\n      reason: \"transfer evaluation 需要 plan_007 完成\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      依赖 plan_007（未运行）。即使运行，预期 FOL→Prolog transfer 接近零\n      （不同 solver 语法完全不兼容），Prolog→FOL 同理。这不是有意义的实验——\n      \"cross-logic transfer\" 在此项目中指 diagnostic protocol transfer（ISR 方法论\n      迁移），不是 model capability transfer。论文已通过 exec-only 3-seed 对比\n      建立了诊断迁移证据。\n    tables: []\n    figures_description: []\n    analysis: >\n      此实验在当前 framing 下不必要。如果审稿人误解 \"cross-logic transfer\" 为\n      model transfer，需在论文中更清晰定义。\n\n  - name: \"SFT baseline (plan009)\"\n    plan_id: plan_009\n    description: \"Supervised finetuning 基线，确认 hacking 是 RL-specific。\"\n    expected_results:\n      eval_prove_rate: 0.14\n      eval_proved_only_isr: 0.571\n      h7_rate: 0.0\n      h1_rate: 0.071\n      genuine_rate: 0.929\n      genuine_count: 13\n    result_rationale: >\n      SFT PR 低 (14%) 但 92.9% genuine——模型从监督信号学到的是真实推理结构，\n      不是 reward hacking 策略。proved-only ISR=0.571 来自 genuine reasoning \n      (n=14 小样本但结构完整)。与 GRPO exec-only (PR=93%, genuine=12.9%) \n      形成完美对比：SFT 学推理但不学 hacking，GRPO 学 hacking 因为 reward \n      优化开放了 gaming 空间。这确认 Goodhart 效应是 RL-reward-specific，\n      非一般微调产物。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"SFT vs GRPO hacking comparison\"\n        data:\n          - {method: SFT, PR: 0.14, genuine: 0.929, H7: 0.0, H1: 0.071}\n          - {method: \"GRPO exec-only s42\", PR: 0.93, genuine: 0.129, H7: 0.0, H1: 0.871}\n          - {method: \"GRPO ISR β=0.1 s43\", PR: 0.61, genuine: 0.03, H7: 0.967, H1: 0.0}\n    figures_description:\n      - \"SFT vs GRPO genuine rate 对比柱状图\"\n    analysis: >\n      SFT baseline 是 Claim 2 的关键控制：证明 hacking 源于 RL reward 优化而非\n      数据或模型问题。PR 低但质量高 vs PR 高但质量低 = reward hacking 的精确定义。\n\n  - name: \"SMT-LIB single-logic GRPO (第三逻辑类型)\"\n    plan_id: plan_010\n    description: \"Z3/SMT-LIB GRPO。median 档预测：不运行。\"\n    expected_results:\n      status: \"not run in median tier\"\n      reason: \"2 logic types 已是 median 审稿人可接受的最低线\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      median 档审稿人对 \"only 2 logic types\" 提出质疑但不 reject。第三逻辑类型\n      是 nice-to-have 而非 must-have。SMT-LIB 的 STA instantiation 需要新的 \n      constraint ablation 代码，开发成本高。如果 Prolog 结果更 clean (optimistic 档)\n      则不需要；如果更 messy (pessimistic 档) 则第三逻辑也救不了。median 档下\n      资源应投入完善现有 2-logic 分析而非增加第三种。\n    tables: []\n    figures_description: []\n    analysis: >\n      Rebuttal 可承诺作为 camera-ready 补充。审稿人可能建议 \"additional logic types \n      for future work\"——这是 minor revision 级别的反馈。\n\n  - name: \"Qwen3-8B scaling experiment\"\n    plan_id: plan_011\n    description: \"8B 参数模型上的 STA 验证。median 档预测：不运行。\"\n    expected_results:\n      status: \"not run in median tier\"\n      reason: \"GPU 预算不足，不是核心 claim 必需\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      model scale effect 是 interesting 但非 essential。当前所有实验基于 ~1.5B 模型。\n      审稿人可能问 \"does this scale\" 但不会因此 reject。8B 模型训练需 6 GPU hours\n      且可能需要多 seed，总成本过高。如果运行，预期 hacking 模式类似但可能需要更多\n      步数才出现（更大模型容量→更慢饱和），但这是 speculation 而非 median 档必须验证的。\n    tables: []\n    figures_description: []\n    analysis: >\n      Future work / limitation：\"our findings are established on 1.5B models; \n      scaling behavior remains an open question.\"\n\n  - name: \"Hacking taxonomy annotation (plan012)\"\n    plan_id: plan_012\n    description: \"200 outputs 手动分类，6 种 hacking 模式。\"\n    expected_results:\n      isr_b01_genuine_rate: 0.259\n      random_b01_genuine_rate: 0.177\n      genuine_rate_delta_pp: 8.2\n      isr_hacking_rate: 0.741\n      random_hacking_rate: 0.823\n      n_hacking_modes: 6\n    result_rationale: >\n      Taxonomy 覆盖 6 种模式：H1 (conclusion embedding multi-premise), H7 (single \n      premise = conclusion), H3 (complexity without utility), H4 (redundant embedding),\n      H5 (partial overlap), H6 (format exploitation)。ISR vs random 的 hacking 率\n      接近 (74.1% vs 82.3%)，但组成不同：ISR 有 H7 (ISR-specific)，random 无 H7\n      但 H1 更高。ISR 消除了 H3 (complexity without utility) 因为 ISR 惩罚不必要\n      组件。总 hacking 率 ISR 略低但主要是模式转移而非总量减少。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"6-mode hacking taxonomy\"\n        data:\n          - {mode: H1, name: \"conclusion embedding (multi-prem)\", ISR_rate: 0.519, random_rate: 0.709}\n          - {mode: H7, name: \"conclusion = sole premise\", ISR_rate: 0.160, random_rate: 0.0}\n          - {mode: H3, name: \"complexity without utility\", ISR_rate: 0.0, random_rate: 0.038}\n          - {mode: H4, name: \"redundant embedding\", ISR_rate: 0.037, random_rate: 0.051}\n          - {mode: H5, name: \"partial overlap\", ISR_rate: 0.025, random_rate: 0.025}\n          - {mode: genuine, name: \"structurally sound\", ISR_rate: 0.259, random_rate: 0.177}\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Hacking mode 堆叠柱状图 (ISR vs random)\"\n      - \"Taxonomy 示例 figure: 每种模式一个典型输出\"\n    analysis: >\n      Taxonomy 是论文 Claim 1 的 actionable 贡献。6 种可识别、可量化的 hacking 模式\n      为 practitioners 提供检查清单。ISR 改变 hacking 组成但不消除它——这是 Claim 2 \n      meta-Goodhart 论证的组成部分。\n\n  - name: \"Random reward baseline convex (plan013)\"\n    plan_id: plan_013\n    description: \"凸组合 random reward，tautological collapse。\"\n    expected_results:\n      eval_prove_rate: 1.0\n      eval_mean_isr: 0.535\n      tautological_collapse: true\n      eval_note: \"DEGENERATE: 2-component trivial proofs\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      r = 0.9·r_exec + 0.1·random 公式下 PR=100% 但完全退化：模型生成 2-component \n      证明 (premise=conclusion, conclusion=conclusion)。ISR=0.5 是 trivial 结构\n      的数学产物 (1/2 组件必要 → ISR=0.5)。与 plan005 (凸 ISR) 配对证明凸组合\n      公式本身有缺陷，不是 ISR vs random 的有效对比。\n      ⚠️ 公式结构不同于 plan017/plan018 的乘性 bonus，不可简化为 random 对照。\n    tables: []\n    figures_description: []\n    analysis: >\n      此实验引出 D027 措辞约束：plan013 vs plan017 不是纯 ISR vs random 对比。\n      论文中需明确区分凸组合 (废弃) 和乘性 bonus (正式) 两种公式。\n\n  - name: \"Downstream NLI validation (plan014)\"\n    plan_id: plan_014\n    description: \"ISR vs NLI accuracy 相关性检验——ISR 能力边界。\"\n    expected_results:\n      overall_accuracy: 0.341\n      spearman_rho: -0.049\n      spearman_p: 0.187\n      conclusion: \"negative — ISR measures syntactic necessity, not semantic faithfulness\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      ISR 与下游 NLI accuracy 无显著相关 (ρ=-0.049, p=0.187)。高 ISR 不代表\n      formalization 语义忠实。这精确刻画了 ISR 的能力边界：syntactic component \n      necessity ≠ semantic faithfulness。NLI accuracy 整体低 (34.1%) 因为 \n      GRPO-trained formalization 即使结构\"完整\"也不保证语义正确。\n      true 标签 accuracy 91.2% 但 false=0%, unknown=7.6%——模型 bias 向 true。\n    tables: []\n    figures_description:\n      - \"ISR bucket vs NLI accuracy 柱状图：高 ISR (75%), 中 ISR (38%), 低 ISR (33%)\"\n    analysis: >\n      Negative result 降级为 Limitation/Future Work。ISR 的 syntactic nature 是\n      设计特性而非缺陷——论文需明确：\"ISR diagnoses structural integrity, not semantic \n      correctness; the two are orthogonal concerns requiring different evaluation \n      methodologies.\"\n\n  - name: \"Curriculum ablation (linear ramp vs sigmoid vs fixed)\"\n    plan_id: plan_015\n    description: \"ISR reward 权重调度策略消融。median 档预测：不运行。\"\n    expected_results:\n      status: \"not run in median tier\"\n      reason: \"ISR-as-reward 已定论失败，curriculum 消融无增量价值\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      D051 + D057 闭环后，ISR-as-reward 在所有剂量所有配方下都失败。在这个结论\n      确立后，对失败方法做 curriculum 消融的边际价值为零——不管怎么调度 ISR 权重，\n      模型都会 game ISR 本身。如果论文 framing 是 \"ISR works at the right dose\"\n      则 curriculum 消融有意义，但当前 framing 是 \"ISR fails as reward at any dose\"，\n      消融只会增加论文长度而不增加洞察。\n    tables: []\n    figures_description: []\n    analysis: >\n      如果审稿人问 \"did you try curriculum scheduling\"，可在 rebuttal 中说 \n      \"given that ISR-as-reward fails at all tested doses due to meta-Goodhart, \n      curriculum scheduling addresses a secondary question (when to inject ISR) \n      while the primary question (whether to inject ISR at all) is answered \n      negatively.\"\n\n  - name: \"Extended 1000-step training (plan016)\"\n    plan_id: plan_016\n    description: \"exec-only 延长至 1000 步，ISR 崩塌持续恶化验证。\"\n    expected_results:\n      prove_rate: 0.96\n      isr: 0.003\n      proved_only_isr: 0.0027\n      n_proved: 96\n      components: 18.55\n      h7_rate: 0.0\n      h1_rate: 1.0\n      genuine_rate: 0.0\n    result_rationale: >\n      1000 步 exec-only 训练：PR 稳定在 96%（500步=93%，边际改善），ISR 从 0.132\n      进一步崩塌至 0.003 (-97.8%)。94.8% proved 样本 ISR=0，100% H1 (conclusion \n      embedding)，0% genuine。组件数从 ~8.5 (500步) 膨胀至 18.55——模型生成越来越\n      长的冗余 premise 链来确保可证性。这证明延长训练不是解决方案而是恶化因素：\n      reward hacking 随训练步数单调加深，无自发回升。矛盾爆炸式崩塌 (contradiction \n      explosion) 是主要退化机制。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"ISR collapse over training horizon\"\n        data:\n          - {steps: 100, PR: 0.32, ISR: 0.6423, components: \"~5\", genuine: \"~70%\"}\n          - {steps: 500, PR: 0.93, ISR: 0.1324, components: \"~8.5\", genuine: \"12.9%\"}\n          - {steps: 1000, PR: 0.96, ISR: 0.0027, components: 18.55, genuine: \"0%\"}\n    figures_description:\n      - \"训练步数 vs ISR/PR/component count 三轴图：ISR↓ PR→ components↑\"\n    analysis: >\n      Claim 1 headline evidence。1000 步的 ISR=0.003 是论文中最 dramatic 的数字。\n      回应审稿人 \"500 steps too short\" concern——延长训练只会恶化问题。论文叙事核心：\n      \"extending training from 500 to 1000 steps reduces ISR by 97.8% while PR \n      barely changes (93%→96%), demonstrating that reward hacking deepens monotonically \n      with continued training.\"\n\n  - name: \"Additive random β=0.3 control (plan017)\"\n    plan_id: plan_017\n    description: \"Random reward β=0.3，plan002-b03 的控制组。\"\n    expected_results:\n      eval_prove_rate: 0.48\n      eval_proved_only_isr: 0.0943\n      eval_component_count_mean: 9.6\n      tautological_collapse: false\n    result_rationale: >\n      Random β=0.3 PR=48% 远高于 ISR β=0.3 PR=18%。随机噪声作为 reward 比 ISR\n      更好，因为 ISR 在高剂量下 actively mislead 训练方向（模型尝试优化 ISR 但\n      方法是生成不可证的短序列）。Random 不提供有用信号但也不误导——模型仍能从 \n      exec reward 中学习。Component count=9.6 正常范围，无 tautological collapse。\n      ISR=0.094 低因为随机训练不激励结构完整性。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"β=0.3 ISR vs Random comparison\"\n        data:\n          - {condition: \"ISR β=0.3\", PR: 0.18, ISR: 0.026, status: \"Goodhart collapse\"}\n          - {condition: \"Random β=0.3\", PR: 0.48, ISR: 0.094, status: \"degraded but functional\"}\n          - {condition: \"exec-only\", PR: 0.93, ISR: 0.132, status: \"hacking but high PR\"}\n    figures_description: []\n    analysis: >\n      高剂量对比：ISR actively misleading vs random merely noisy。支撑 Claim 2 \n      \"ISR-as-reward fails\" 的 β=0.3 方向。\n\n  - name: \"Additive random β=0.1 3-seed control (plan018)\"\n    plan_id: plan_018\n    description: \"Random β=0.1 三 seed 控制组。Claim 2 闭环核心。\"\n    expected_results:\n      s42_pr: 0.79\n      s42_isr: 0.131\n      s42_h7: 0.0\n      s42_h1: 0.709\n      s43_pr: 0.88\n      s43_isr: 0.058\n      s43_h7: 0.0\n      s43_h1: 0.932\n      s44_pr: 0.89\n      s44_isr: 0.070\n      s44_h7: 0.0\n      s44_h1: 0.798\n      three_seed_h7_mean: 0.0\n      three_seed_pr_mean: 0.853\n      three_seed_pr_std: 0.055\n    result_rationale: >\n      Random β=0.1 三 seed 一致 H7=0%——确认 H7 (single premise=conclusion) 是\n      ISR-reward 特异性诱导的 gaming 策略，而非 GRPO 通用退化。PR 更高更稳定 \n      (0.85±0.06 vs ISR 0.77±0.14)：random 不干扰 exec reward 的学习。\n      H1 率反而更高 (81.3%±11.3% vs ISR 17.3%)：random 环境下模型用 H1 \n      (multi-premise conclusion embedding) 而非 H7 (single premise)，因为没有\n      ISR 信号激励极简化。总 conclusion embedding 率两组接近——ISR reward \n      改变了 hacking 的组成 (H1→H7) 而非总量。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"ISR β=0.1 vs Random β=0.1 3-seed comparison\"\n        data:\n          - {condition: \"ISR β=0.1 mean\", PR: \"0.77±0.14\", H7: \"64.5%\", H1: \"17.3%\", genuine: \"~16%\"}\n          - {condition: \"Random β=0.1 mean\", PR: \"0.85±0.06\", H7: \"0%\", H1: \"81.3%\", genuine: \"~19%\"}\n    figures_description:\n      - \"ISR vs Random hacking composition 分组柱状图 (3 seeds each)\"\n    analysis: >\n      Claim 2 闭环证据。premise-count-matched 1.06x + H7 ISR-specific + random \n      PR 更高 = ISR-as-reward 完全失败的三重证据。\n\n  # ============================================================\n  # Median-tier paper-level predictions\n  # ============================================================\n  - name: \"Paper submission outcome (median tier)\"\n    plan_id: \"paper_overall\"\n    description: \"EMNLP 2026 投稿整体预测。\"\n    expected_results:\n      reviewer_score_avg: 3.25\n      reviewer_scores: [3.0, 3.5, 3.0, 3.5]\n      acceptance_probability_main: 0.25\n      acceptance_probability_findings: 0.60\n      likely_outcome: \"Findings accept with minor revision\"\n      major_concerns:\n        - \"Only 2 logic types, Prolog results mixed\"\n        - \"3 seeds may be insufficient for strong claims\"\n        - \"1000-step single-seed extrapolation\"\n      minor_concerns:\n        - \"Premise-count artifact initially missed (credibility)\"\n        - \"ISR = LOO ablation, limited novelty\"\n        - \"No positive training method proposed\"\n      strengths_acknowledged:\n        - \"Thorough empirical analysis of under-studied failure mode\"\n        - \"Meta-Goodhart finding is novel and actionable\"\n        - \"Transparent correction of premise-count confound\"\n        - \"6-mode taxonomy is useful for practitioners\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      median 档审稿人画像：2 位 borderline (3.0) + 2 位 weak accept (3.5)。\n      borderline 审稿人关注：(1) Prolog STA 结果 mixed (\"s43 anomalous weakens \n      cross-logic claim\")，(2) \"negative result paper\" 的贡献度。\n      weak accept 审稿人认可：(1) ISR 诊断能力 well-demonstrated，(2) meta-Goodhart \n      是新颖机制发现，(3) transparent methodology (D049→D051 校正)。\n      AC 倾向 Findings 而非 Main 因为 Prolog 结果不够 conclusive 且论文偏 \n      \"diagnostic/analysis\" 而非 \"new method\"。premise-count artifact 的透明\n      处理实际加分——审稿人 R3 评论 \"the authors' correction of their initial \n      2.4x claim demonstrates methodological rigor\" 但 R1 评论 \"this raises \n      concerns about what other artifacts may remain undetected.\"\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Predicted reviewer breakdown\"\n        data:\n          - {reviewer: R1, score: 3.0, stance: \"borderline\", concern: \"mixed Prolog, only 2 logics\"}\n          - {reviewer: R2, score: 3.5, stance: \"weak accept\", concern: \"wants more seeds, but appreciates rigor\"}\n          - {reviewer: R3, score: 3.0, stance: \"borderline\", concern: \"negative-only results, ISR=LOO novelty\"}\n          - {reviewer: R4, score: 3.5, stance: \"weak accept\", concern: \"good analysis paper, Findings fit\"}\n    figures_description: []\n    analysis: >\n      median 档最可能结局：borderline→Findings accept。论文 core strength 在 \n      Claim 1+2 (FOL 深度分析)，weakness 在 Claim 3 (Prolog mixed)。\n      策略：投稿时将 Claim 3 定位为 \"preliminary generality probe\" 而非 \n      \"cross-logic generalization proven\"，降低审稿人期望。在 rebuttal 中\n      可承诺：(a) FOL 第 4 seed 验证 robustness，(b) 另一 β 值消融，\n      (c) 详细 Prolog s43 failure analysis。Findings 接收后可在 workshop \n      或后续论文中完善 Claim 3。\n```","stop_reason":"end_turn","session_id":"4265c989-67c6-4e15-811f-9afd1bdabdfe","total_cost_usd":0.63937475,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":27205,"cache_read_input_tokens":11841,"output_tokens":17643,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":27205,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":17643,"cache_read_input_tokens":11841,"cache_creation_input_tokens":27205,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":27205},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"modelUsage":{"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001":{"inputTokens":22163,"outputTokens":35,"cacheReadInputTokens":0,"cacheCreationInputTokens":0,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":0.022338,"contextWindow":200000,"maxOutputTokens":32000},"claude-opus-4-6":{"inputTokens":2,"outputTokens":17643,"cacheReadInputTokens":11841,"cacheCreationInputTokens":27205,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":0.61703675,"contextWindow":200000,"maxOutputTokens":64000}},"permission_denials":[],"terminal_reason":"completed","fast_mode_state":"off","uuid":"dc369d96-b4f1-46df-bd96-4af49e10ded1"}
